# Supabase project credentials (paste the values from your Supabase project dashboard)
# into a local copy of this file named .env (the .gitignore already excludes .env).
#
# Where to find these two values:
#   1. Go to https://supabase.com/dashboard and open your project.
#   2. In the left sidebar click "Project Settings" (the gear icon).
#   3. In the API section you'll see:
#        - Project URL  → copy into VITE_SUPABASE_URL
#        - Project API keys → anon / public → copy into VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#
# After saving this file as .env, restart Vite (npm run dev) or rebuild
# (npm run build) so the new env vars are picked up.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
